{
  "module": "tickle",
  "title": "Why Can't You Tickle Yourself?",
  "music": "ambient",
  "length_scale": 1.08,
  "punch": 0.06,
  "max_clip": 2.6,
  "shots": [
    {
      "vo": "Why can't you tickle yourself?",
      "highlight": "#ffd23f",
      "scene": "touch",
      "params": {"who": "self"},
      "cuts": [
        {"at": "tickle", "scene": "brain", "params": {"mode": "cancel"}}
      ]
    },
    {
      "vo": "Every time you move, your brain predicts what you're about to feel.",
      "highlight": "#57b8ff",
      "scene": "touch",
      "params": {"who": "self", "az0": 0.3, "az1": 0.2, "el0": 0.35, "el1": 0.3, "dist0": 16, "dist1": 14},
      "cuts": [
        {"at": "brain", "scene": "brain", "params": {"mode": "predict", "cereb": 1}},
        {"at": "about", "scene": "brain", "params": {"mode": "predict", "cereb": 1, "az0": 1.6, "az1": 1.45, "dist0": 17, "dist1": 16, "ty0": -0.4, "ty1": -0.4}}
      ]
    },
    {
      "vo": "A region at the back, called the cerebellum, sends a forecast of the touch.",
      "highlight": "#57b8ff",
      "scene": "brain",
      "params": {"mode": "predict", "cereb": 1, "az0": 2.4, "az1": 2.2, "el0": 0.1, "el1": 0.15},
      "cuts": [
        {"at": "cerebellum,", "params": {"mode": "predict", "cereb": 1, "labels": 1, "az0": 1.2, "az1": 1.1, "dist0": 18, "dist1": 17, "ty0": -0.6, "ty1": -0.6}},
        {"at": "forecast", "params": {"mode": "predict", "cereb": 1, "labels": 1}}
      ]
    },
    {
      "vo": "When the real touch arrives, it matches the forecast, so your brain turns it down.",
      "highlight": "#57b8ff",
      "scene": "brain",
      "params": {"mode": "cancel", "labels": 1, "az0": 0.7, "az1": 0.6},
      "cuts": [
        {"at": "matches", "params": {"mode": "cancel", "labels": 0, "az0": 0.3, "az1": 0.2, "el0": 0.4, "el1": 0.35, "dist0": 10, "dist1": 9, "tx0": 1.4, "tx1": 1.4, "ty0": 2.4, "ty1": 2.4}},
        {"at": "down.", "scene": "touch", "params": {"who": "self", "fire": 0.05, "az0": -0.8, "az1": -0.7, "dist0": 10, "dist1": 9}}
      ]
    },
    {
      "vo": "But when someone else tickles you, there's no forecast. The surprise is what makes it tickle.",
      "highlight": "#ff9a3a",
      "scene": "touch",
      "params": {"who": "other"},
      "cuts": [
        {"at": "no", "scene": "brain", "params": {"mode": "surprise", "labels": 1}},
        {"at": "surprise", "scene": "brain", "params": {"mode": "surprise", "az0": 0.3, "az1": 0.2, "el0": 0.4, "el1": 0.35, "dist0": 11, "dist1": 10, "tx0": 1.4, "tx1": 1.4, "ty0": 2.2, "ty1": 2.2}},
        {"at": "tickle.", "scene": "touch", "params": {"who": "other", "az0": 0.6, "az1": 0.5, "el0": 0.3, "el1": 0.28, "dist0": 9, "dist1": 8}}
      ]
    },
    {
      "vo": "In one experiment, people tickled their own palm using a robot.",
      "highlight": "#ffd23f",
      "scene": "robot",
      "params": {"delay": 0},
      "cuts": [
        {"at": "own", "params": {"delay": 0, "az0": 0.9, "az1": 0.8, "el0": 0.6, "el1": 0.55, "dist0": 15, "dist1": 14}},
        {"at": "robot.", "params": {"delay": 0, "az0": -0.5, "az1": -0.4, "el0": 0.3, "el1": 0.28, "dist0": 13, "dist1": 12, "tx0": 0.6, "tx1": 0.6, "ty0": -0.8, "ty1": -0.8}}
      ]
    },
    {
      "vo": "Add a delay of just a fifth of a second, and it felt more ticklish.",
      "highlight": "#ff4b4b",
      "scene": "robot",
      "params": {"delay": 1},
      "cuts": [
        {"at": "felt", "scene": "brain", "params": {"mode": "surprise", "az0": -0.4, "az1": -0.3}}
      ]
    },
    {
      "vo": "Even rats laugh when they're tickled, in squeaks too high for us to hear.",
      "highlight": "#7fd8ff",
      "scene": "rat",
      "params": {"tickle": 1},
      "cuts": [
        {"at": "squeaks", "params": {"tickle": 1, "labels": 1, "az0": -0.4, "az1": -0.3, "el0": 0.25, "el1": 0.22, "dist0": 13, "dist1": 12, "tx0": 1.2, "tx1": 1.3, "ty0": 0.6, "ty1": 0.6}}
      ]
    }
  ]
}
